OL,3,CMurder investigation launched after
OL,4,Cman dies following violent disorder
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched by police after the death of
OL,8,Fa 56-year-old man near Pontypool.
OL,10,FOfficers from Gwent Police were called
OL,11,Fto Mill Road in Pontnewynydd, near
OL,12,FPontypool, on Thursday 6 August,
OL,13,Ffollowing violent disorder.
OL,15,FGwent Police has confirmed one man,
OL,16,FAnthony "Tony" Jones, 56, from Brecon,
OL,17,Fhas died after receiving life-
OL,18,Fthreatening injuries. They said his
OL,19,Ffamily are being supported by
OL,20,Fspecialist officers.
