OL,3,CMurder investigation launched after
OL,4,Cman dies following violent disorder
OL,6,FIn total, seven men, aged 31, 39, 40,
OL,7,F45, 59, 61, and 71, have been arrested
OL,8,Fin connection with the disorder and
OL,9,Fremain in police custody.
OL,11,FSenior investigating officer,
OL,12,FDetective Superintendent Laura Bartley
OL,13,Fsaid: "We recognise that reports of
OL,14,Fthis nature will cause concern in our
OL,15,Fcommunity, but we have officers
OL,16,Fworking around the clock conducting
OL,17,Fenquiries as part of the investigation.
