OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1786483115
OL,3,CMurder investigation launched after
OL,4,Cman dies following violent disorder
OL,6,F"We're trying to establish the
OL,7,Fmovements of those involved both
OL,8,Fbefore and after the disorder and are
OL,9,Fasking motorists who were driving
OL,10,Falong Hospital Road, Mill Road and the
OL,11,Fsurrounding areas between 6pm and 9pm
OL,12,Fon Thursday to check their dashcam
OL,13,Ffootage."
